{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15897","headline":"雪 · 张南史","name":"雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪，雪。\n花片，玉屑。\n结阴风，凝暮节。\n高岭虚晶，平原广洁。\n初从云外飘，还向空中噎。\n千门万户皆静，兽炭皮裘自热。\n此时双舞洛阳人，谁悟郢中歌断绝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张南史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}